# The web app's runtime env file is a symlink to the repo-root `.env`
# (create it with `ln -s ../../.env apps/web/.env`).
#
# The CANONICAL variable reference lives in the repo-root `.env.example` —
# every variable the web app reads, grouped into required core, optional
# subsystems, and cloud-only. Copy what you need into the root `.env`.
#
# Image-based self-hosters start from `selfhost/.env.example` instead
# (paired with `selfhost/docker-compose.yaml`; runbook: /INSTALL.md).
